1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Kukir Vyan Ivei, Kukir Nedmet

2
00:00:04,207 --> 00:00:06,627
Ivei Maratvan Kormantol

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:09,647
Mythal Selema Horkenet

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,000
Kukir Harkiton

5
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,253
Annorweyn attunes the Gem of the Weave
아노르웨인이 '위브의 보석'을 조율하고 있네.

6
00:00:19,453 --> 00:00:22,786
But she cannot take command of the Mythal
허나 그녀는 미쌀을 통제하지 못하고 있다네.

7
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:28,000
Some other force already controls it
이미 다른 힘이 미쌀을 장악하고 있어.

8
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:38,967
The Baelnorn told you
he destroyed his Gem of the Weave?
그 베일노른이 자신의 '위브의 보석'을 파괴했다고요?

9
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,720
We will see about that.
확인해 봐야겠군요.

10
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,080
Come, let us talk with Miroden the Silver Blade.
오세요, 미로덴 실버블레이드와 이야기 해봐야겠어요.
